  "intro": "Day 1: Arrival in Cusco & Acclimatization The city of Cusco is the gateway to the Andes. Your first […]",
  "content_html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/blog/content/destinos-top-peru-33e5bd82fc.webp\" srcset=\"images/blog/content/destinos-top-peru-33e5bd82fc-640.webp 640w, images/blog/content/destinos-top-peru-33e5bd82fc-1024.webp 1024w, images/blog/content/destinos-top-peru-33e5bd82fc.webp 1400w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 900px\" alt=\"Imagen actual: destinos-top-peru-cusco\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.4104743624897176;width:453px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"day-1-arrival-in-cusco-acclimatization\"> Day 1: Arrival in Cusco &amp; Acclimatization</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/V9PIidKpEvy1jgLY1HdjKFk2-zvFVN68MyjrCZN3KzUOHzrz4D9E-bRPjMEM6x4dqQrgD8TV3d0gooC_m7zG9gM2KJjgTwZw1cAEoWW2LuMbWaDWToxfba7UvVpi15LxBKLjra0I8FGm_UIQiqNr8SecOsvlwYmX3mQKWUltfe9fD1mxjHdHxG6mDKePFcci?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/JYD7xA7ovFG5QTUrahVv2wtUt-cKB2g4L4SEMaDM-l2ypt-8U-NlPxC5K3q9_Y0-ZwXco0hHkusXbVTUDF4IzBkVOyQrk5D3qE8rizoRPKHtsSs8tSiIG6xbnFOChJ97DYvkcqfJbbZnF4_9ic9lPz9qbISp3_gUOM8JzJKCev6m7sIQtNHMnx-zzD8QqD3_?purpose=fullsize\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.3872240013483903;width:463px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The city of Cusco is the gateway to the Andes. Your first day should be dedicated to rest and adapting to the altitude.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"recommendations\">Recommendations:</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Walk around the Plaza de Armas</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Visit San Blas neighborhood</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Try traditional Peruvian food</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> If you’re looking for organized tours and full packages, check out the tour options from<br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://www.gtperutravel.com/?lang=es&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com#nuestros-paquetes\">GT Peru Travel</a></p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"day-2-sacred-valley-of-the-incas\"> Day 2: Sacred Valley of the Incas</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/JA4gWvfIl3oKKArT5V0AYHvI2eh6Y-d30R7zKuHJ-NoPqtkAARcxSlOuysqPeU45Xtk1WeLsoF9e9Odyt8Akz9nwkmvmmZbFkM-wfAfCXWGy3cGYeHQGKGbt1nN9-MkThvvJFu9qn7CBkjv_wdNuaHjKvQjZjQoZOwX8B3_nWe78v8E49UoelUuA7DreF9sz?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/2q1peAdrS7N6cJboF9NbKGJNFOcJ-4wUT2YiDAy4_Vcjd5nutIFM_OGrazg6IGwRM7gM78ve6xkK-riyaTekk2KTtsKuNfPyXNbj4ZHDApmIX1CMc7_WNIdxXKfvOKKz0UuqHeEjAyEE4-ooUx1r1TeHlsnLvrldacmbHpnjgH-MdX5bC1cVAskB0NB_Am5U?purpose=fullsize\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.3337222492302707;width:488px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Visit stunning locations such as:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Pisac</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ollantaytambo</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Urubamba</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Many travelers choose guided packages to simplify logistics and save time.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"day-3-machu-picchu\"> Day 3: Machu Picchu</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/xD4T3ydFuEF3WoHk6bNVdARe2CEvbN4Su_12_DuYM-i1GxYmzpLUN8HA1uvkVA8AHJ5KqeON_g24PesZE448KyacB8qqIbGaPD1m2PrH4EHiZQjCzRDVhIo3l5HhFeWEvQA8s_516VzngNhd84ZZr0BLHo6jZEdVd8_eAMyg-xVI6qQwY29cHmjz6wXsF8Yo?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/j9YN24CPr1klktol1qIKzpDinVtD8Lh4swZl1WRje0InDkrSD2ZDfuFbY1bAmUVCHhxrXyboUIsAUq8ceuOE0tOltouvDWMKQ3ADwAC5PM7HWtcYwRxVZaAdtMlhNE5K_r0Vpz6tpLKuPiYJt1EaHXOE0cYR-5xNXx5QdriTJhCN-OODAowhp0C7WkSddkLQ?purpose=fullsize\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.5000364511190494;width:513px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The most anticipated day of your trip.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A visit to Machu Picchu typically includes:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Train transportation</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Eco bus transfer</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Guided tour</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">GT Peru Travel offers customizable tours to Machu Picchu and Cusco experiences.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"day-4-rainbow-mountain\"> Day 4: Rainbow Mountain</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/qd8fGh0NIxYgDy5Ro6EqY2-zoaQOuPCVTqoFFgVEb1cg7Gpqk-A3gFF5gKvUlcPrfmqbL7FMb3eObbhODh50Nvvx_y-iZRZf8Le2YkSajI2QFHhFdReS8iDNuF_edb2V3QbaQv3JQaG4-8368W2nJ-5SwhUrOtTwfWDRINFYIOFbxdjJY4umjjhQfyuat5Q_?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/kb06q-JTGfsXvnP2Hnl-ZJXgBY-r8jM0JGrDvF5_CKQEMMbPS5kSMue-f9tZT2d841eXddhKCOiE1PzOoYCUVQpqe_09AvH98UCGyvQ8fAub45vprIclw5yvurpSkuWUUV8izmUrA2kD4vtObdB1Y0s-rlFBi8D6oJQ_AICmIzKm8Eo8AuM-i3RhdOrIzQKC?purpose=fullsize\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.5000364511190494;width:513px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The famous Rainbow Mountain is one of the most popular tours in Peru.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"day-5-humantay-lake\"> Day 5: Humantay Lake</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A breathtaking hike to<br>Humantay Lake<br>surrounded by snow-capped mountains.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"day-6-cusco-city-tour\"> Day 6: Cusco City Tour</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Visit:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Qorikancha</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sacsayhuamán</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tambomachay</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"day-7-shopping-departure\"> Day 7: Shopping &amp; Departure</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/CYdfoSiBbjwU73PgwsJw4Ox8JWgXXjjFJFUBNZFmZRnQnveRCuPv3ak1DBIxY3BRt4aDsnGuw_ImKaDNl96KA0KiO2KEAM93GTIOwAeDwNAjN9mAV-KAj0kg-iXwbbZuKZoT24ISEBNmtm-EmYbe6wQIm9Ham2XWvy_5VKypcSo?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/h06wTHLq39vtO0Ap5BmGyLzh0n0YFKJ9JsZK6juwZJcVDXywXgbmprnhtnVmB8Q84y4Bk_N248_H1oX6e-DMPz-f4HPPCSzImaT4sBxVZHf0haRRFi-IX4N4Gp0O9tL7m8y2ZHbRtFvdYM3zI2cjnGKtOPDgXJg_UdjfrDNxS60_dFAbCrf2G8uTmKRxHA6R?purpose=fullsize\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.1252939567951874;width:408px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Enjoy your last day with:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Local handicrafts</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cafés and restaurants</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Final exploration of the city</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"> Travel Tips for Cusco</h1>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Best time to visit: April to October</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Book Machu Picchu tickets in advance</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Wear layered clothing</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Stay hydrated and acclimatize properly</li>\n</ul>\n",
